{
  "id": "talk_ep1",
  "type": "episode",
  "title": "Open Talk – The Desire Contract",
  "audio": "audio/talk_ep1/full.mp3",
  "dur": 678.034,
  "sents": [
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Hello everyone! Welcome to Open Talk! My name is Ethan.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_6b8c92d71b28.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_6b8c92d71b28.mp3",
      "d": 4.362,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.362,
      "segment": "intro",
      "h": "Intro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "And I'm Paula.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_6909c1b4442e.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_6909c1b4442e.mp3",
      "d": 1.202,
      "start": 4.676,
      "end": 5.878,
      "segment": "intro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "And this is our very first episode, and we are so happy you're here.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_bdebd71b7f39.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_bdebd71b7f39.mp3",
      "d": 4.18,
      "start": 6.348,
      "end": 10.527,
      "segment": "intro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Yes! Today we have a really useful lesson for you.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_508c15d5d146.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_508c15d5d146.mp3",
      "d": 3.892,
      "start": 10.998,
      "end": 14.89,
      "segment": "intro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "That's right. Today with Paula we're going to talk about wanting things — maybe too many things.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_8fa7e3922776.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_8fa7e3922776.mp3",
      "d": 5.799,
      "start": 15.36,
      "end": 21.159,
      "segment": "intro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Ugh, I know that feeling. A new phone, a bigger apartment, a better job...",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_4cfb551ceefa.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_4cfb551ceefa.mp3",
      "d": 5.721,
      "start": 21.629,
      "end": 27.35,
      "segment": "intro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Right. And then you feel like you can't be happy until you get all of it.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_afab85fc624d.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_afab85fc624d.mp3",
      "d": 3.709,
      "start": 27.82,
      "end": 31.53,
      "segment": "intro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Exactly. In today's lesson, two friends talk about this problem, and you'll learn some great language for talking about what you want — and what you don't.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_4b8beffb2d83.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_4b8beffb2d83.mp3",
      "d": 9.482,
      "start": 32.0,
      "end": 41.482,
      "segment": "intro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "The idea comes from a thinker named Naval Ravikant. He has a simple but powerful way of looking at desire.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_417e6c42f85a.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_417e6c42f85a.mp3",
      "d": 5.93,
      "start": 41.953,
      "end": 47.882,
      "segment": "intro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Don't worry if that sounds a little serious. The dialogue is a normal conversation, the kind you might have after work.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_0c0f79d83c1a.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_0c0f79d83c1a.mp3",
      "d": 7.811,
      "start": 48.353,
      "end": 56.163,
      "segment": "intro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Great. So, Paula, why don't we start with our \"vocabulary preview\"?",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_143fde3b6e91.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_143fde3b6e91.mp3",
      "d": 4.258,
      "start": 56.633,
      "end": 60.891,
      "segment": "intro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "We have two words in our vocabulary preview today. The first is desire.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_c7ae8b6b9a19.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_c7ae8b6b9a19.mp3",
      "d": 4.78,
      "start": 61.518,
      "end": 66.299,
      "segment": "vocab",
      "h": "Vocabulary Preview"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Desire.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_cb15fa1d01c9.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_cb15fa1d01c9.mp3",
      "d": 0.836,
      "start": 66.612,
      "end": 67.448,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Desire.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_493b2aef4f0e.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_493b2aef4f0e.mp3",
      "d": 1.071,
      "start": 67.683,
      "end": 68.754,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Desire.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_cb15fa1d01c9.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_cb15fa1d01c9.mp3",
      "d": 0.836,
      "start": 68.989,
      "end": 69.825,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "So, a desire is a strong feeling that you want to have something, or do something.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_0e6c0939c68d.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_0e6c0939c68d.mp3",
      "d": 5.93,
      "start": 70.296,
      "end": 76.225,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Right. It's stronger than just \"I kind of want it.\" It's \"I really want it.\"",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_9482beb3b153.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_9482beb3b153.mp3",
      "d": 4.885,
      "start": 76.696,
      "end": 81.58,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "For example, she has a strong desire to open her own studio.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_f5cb263ef7ff.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_f5cb263ef7ff.mp3",
      "d": 4.075,
      "start": 82.051,
      "end": 86.126,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Okay. Our second word today is contract.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_5bf97bab6264.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_5bf97bab6264.mp3",
      "d": 3.004,
      "start": 86.596,
      "end": 89.6,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Contract.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_ea120e3dac68.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_ea120e3dac68.mp3",
      "d": 1.071,
      "start": 89.913,
      "end": 90.984,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Contract.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_f59c7cccad19.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_f59c7cccad19.mp3",
      "d": 0.888,
      "start": 91.22,
      "end": 92.108,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Contract.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_ea120e3dac68.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_ea120e3dac68.mp3",
      "d": 1.071,
      "start": 92.343,
      "end": 93.414,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "A contract is an agreement between two sides. You say yes, I say yes, and now we both have to follow it.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_d39c92757f50.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_d39c92757f50.mp3",
      "d": 6.975,
      "start": 93.884,
      "end": 100.859,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Like when you sign a contract with a salon, or with an apartment.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_726c9a4ecd5c.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_726c9a4ecd5c.mp3",
      "d": 4.127,
      "start": 101.329,
      "end": 105.456,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Exactly. Now, in today's dialogue, you'll hear these two words together: desire contract.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_2b8a2f144f91.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_2b8a2f144f91.mp3",
      "d": 6.557,
      "start": 105.927,
      "end": 112.483,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Desire contract.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_aa0332c10f76.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_aa0332c10f76.mp3",
      "d": 1.567,
      "start": 112.797,
      "end": 114.364,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Desire contract.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_3514545b8de1.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_3514545b8de1.mp3",
      "d": 1.332,
      "start": 114.599,
      "end": 115.931,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "This is a special idea. A desire contract is a contract you make with yourself. You are saying, \"I will be unhappy until I get what I want.\"",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_56b72a962e61.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_56b72a962e61.mp3",
      "d": 9.691,
      "start": 116.402,
      "end": 126.093,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "So every new desire is one more contract you sign — with you.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_2f26ea80fcb2.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_2f26ea80fcb2.mp3",
      "d": 4.049,
      "start": 126.563,
      "end": 130.612,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "These two words come straight from our dialogue. So, why don't we just listen?",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_43b3434bc54b.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_43b3434bc54b.mp3",
      "d": 4.963,
      "start": 131.082,
      "end": 136.046,
      "segment": "vocab"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Lily",
      "t": "Ugh, I spent all night looking at new phones. I want the latest one so badly.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_8d3816dcff80.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_8d3816dcff80.mp3",
      "d": 5.303,
      "start": 136.829,
      "end": 142.132,
      "segment": "dialogue",
      "h": "Dialogue"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Mark",
      "t": "Didn't you just get a new phone last year?",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_434ad9fc15cc.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_434ad9fc15cc.mp3",
      "d": 2.038,
      "start": 142.602,
      "end": 144.64,
      "segment": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Lily",
      "t": "Yeah, but this one is better. And I also want to rent a bigger studio. And maybe start selling my own lash products.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_18ce1b9314a5.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_18ce1b9314a5.mp3",
      "d": 7.053,
      "start": 145.11,
      "end": 152.163,
      "segment": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Mark",
      "t": "Lily, that's a lot of wants at the same time.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_1739c4ff760a.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_1739c4ff760a.mp3",
      "d": 2.821,
      "start": 152.633,
      "end": 155.455,
      "segment": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Lily",
      "t": "I know. I just feel like I can't be happy until I get all of it.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_b8414b33b8b7.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_b8414b33b8b7.mp3",
      "d": 4.545,
      "start": 155.925,
      "end": 160.47,
      "segment": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Mark",
      "t": "I heard an interesting idea about that. People say a desire is a contract you make with yourself to be unhappy until you get what you want. Every new desire is one more desire contract you sign.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_bdd0ac2bb6d4.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_bdd0ac2bb6d4.mp3",
      "d": 11.102,
      "start": 160.94,
      "end": 172.042,
      "segment": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Lily",
      "t": "A contract with myself? So I'm making myself unhappy on purpose?",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_12b9531d38c6.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_12b9531d38c6.mp3",
      "d": 4.963,
      "start": 172.513,
      "end": 177.476,
      "segment": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Mark",
      "t": "Not on purpose. But we pick up a lot of unnecessary desires everywhere — ads, videos, other people's lives.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_108b82716386.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_108b82716386.mp3",
      "d": 7.471,
      "start": 177.946,
      "end": 185.417,
      "segment": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Lily",
      "t": "That's true. I pick them up without even thinking.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_700320180e7c.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_700320180e7c.mp3",
      "d": 4.127,
      "start": 185.887,
      "end": 190.015,
      "segment": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Mark",
      "t": "If you want to be really good at your work, you have to be choosy about your desires. You have to focus.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_c5f9691a34cf.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_c5f9691a34cf.mp3",
      "d": 5.616,
      "start": 190.485,
      "end": 196.101,
      "segment": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Lily",
      "t": "Frankly, I can't be great at everything. I'll just waste my energy.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_8487376775af.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_8487376775af.mp3",
      "d": 4.545,
      "start": 196.571,
      "end": 201.117,
      "segment": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Mark",
      "t": "Exactly. Maybe keep one desire, and let the others go for now.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_43a3d707577a.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_43a3d707577a.mp3",
      "d": 4.258,
      "start": 201.587,
      "end": 205.845,
      "segment": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Lily",
      "t": "Okay. The studio can wait. The phone can wait. I'll focus on my clients this year.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_2cfa0aa2d3ff.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_2cfa0aa2d3ff.mp3",
      "d": 6.165,
      "start": 206.315,
      "end": 212.48,
      "segment": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Wow, Paula, Lily wants a lot of things at the same time.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_bb0a67edf764.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_bb0a67edf764.mp3",
      "d": 3.84,
      "start": 213.264,
      "end": 217.104,
      "segment": "takeaway",
      "h": "Language Takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "I think a lot of us do.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_6fba3f053e96.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_6fba3f053e96.mp3",
      "d": 1.907,
      "start": 217.574,
      "end": 219.481,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Yeah. And that idea — a desire contract — is really interesting. We'll talk more about that later, but first...",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_b7af1ad7a2ef.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_b7af1ad7a2ef.mp3",
      "d": 7.706,
      "start": 219.951,
      "end": 227.657,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "It's time for \"language takeaway\".",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_f2aca112f7f3.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_f2aca112f7f3.mp3",
      "d": 2.038,
      "start": 228.127,
      "end": 230.165,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "There's some great language in this dialogue. Let's start with our first word: shortcut.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_3223f206fb2b.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_3223f206fb2b.mp3",
      "d": 5.747,
      "start": 230.504,
      "end": 236.251,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Shortcut.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_d31d102dc904.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_d31d102dc904.mp3",
      "d": 0.836,
      "start": 236.565,
      "end": 237.401,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Shortcut.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_eb00213786ef.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_eb00213786ef.mp3",
      "d": 0.914,
      "start": 237.636,
      "end": 238.55,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Shortcut.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_d31d102dc904.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_d31d102dc904.mp3",
      "d": 0.836,
      "start": 238.785,
      "end": 239.621,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "To shortcut something means to find a quicker way to do it — you skip the long way.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_43ddacacb63f.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_43ddacacb63f.mp3",
      "d": 4.911,
      "start": 240.091,
      "end": 245.002,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "In the original idea, someone asks: how do you shortcut that desire contract? Is there a quicker way out of it?",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_1a3a29a131b5.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_1a3a29a131b5.mp3",
      "d": 6.635,
      "start": 245.473,
      "end": 252.108,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Right. You don't have to keep every contract you signed with yourself.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_d33a96bca39c.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_d33a96bca39c.mp3",
      "d": 4.075,
      "start": 252.578,
      "end": 256.653,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Let's go to our next phrase now: pick up.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_a814928571c9.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_a814928571c9.mp3",
      "d": 2.743,
      "start": 257.123,
      "end": 259.866,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Pick up.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_e966a4421917.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_e966a4421917.mp3",
      "d": 0.784,
      "start": 260.18,
      "end": 260.963,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Pick up.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_ad42ecc0891d.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_ad42ecc0891d.mp3",
      "d": 0.653,
      "start": 261.198,
      "end": 261.851,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Pick up.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_e966a4421917.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_e966a4421917.mp3",
      "d": 0.784,
      "start": 262.087,
      "end": 262.87,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Now, \"pick up\" can mean \"lift something from the floor,\" but in this dialogue it has a different meaning.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_a0975365b10e.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_a0975365b10e.mp3",
      "d": 5.381,
      "start": 263.34,
      "end": 268.722,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Here, to pick up a desire means to start having it, often without planning to. You just get it from the world around you.",
