      "d": 1.254,
      "start": 288.313,
      "end": 289.567,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Be careful. It's easy to pick up other people's stress.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_cbdc6b36f2c6.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_cbdc6b36f2c6.mp3",
      "d": 3.657,
      "start": 289.881,
      "end": 293.538,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "So you can pick up a habit, an idea, or a desire.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_32cbf2221e8f.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_32cbf2221e8f.mp3",
      "d": 3.344,
      "start": 294.008,
      "end": 297.352,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Exactly. Our next word is choosy.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_12805424faad.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_12805424faad.mp3",
      "d": 3.213,
      "start": 297.822,
      "end": 301.035,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Choosy.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_0ebd4b86c61f.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_0ebd4b86c61f.mp3",
      "d": 0.731,
      "start": 301.349,
      "end": 302.08,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Choosy.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_ea7be4645973.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_ea7be4645973.mp3",
      "d": 1.202,
      "start": 302.315,
      "end": 303.517,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Choosy.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_0ebd4b86c61f.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_0ebd4b86c61f.mp3",
      "d": 0.731,
      "start": 303.752,
      "end": 304.483,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "If you are choosy, you are careful about what you accept. You don't want just anything.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_88b5924ee826.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_88b5924ee826.mp3",
      "d": 5.433,
      "start": 304.953,
      "end": 310.387,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "For example: she's very choosy about her lash glue. She doesn't use just any glue.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_3a297e6fd662.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_3a297e6fd662.mp3",
      "d": 5.198,
      "start": 310.857,
      "end": 316.055,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "And in the dialogue: you have to be choosy about your desires. Don't say yes to every want.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_35e87f82e621.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_35e87f82e621.mp3",
      "d": 5.904,
      "start": 316.526,
      "end": 322.429,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Okay, our next word is frankly.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_57eeda46a316.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_57eeda46a316.mp3",
      "d": 2.56,
      "start": 322.9,
      "end": 325.46,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Frankly.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_5c1115e5a18b.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_5c1115e5a18b.mp3",
      "d": 0.967,
      "start": 325.773,
      "end": 326.74,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Frankly.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_1672a903462a.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_1672a903462a.mp3",
      "d": 0.731,
      "start": 326.975,
      "end": 327.706,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Frankly.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_5c1115e5a18b.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_5c1115e5a18b.mp3",
      "d": 0.967,
      "start": 327.941,
      "end": 328.908,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "We use frankly when we say what we really think, in a direct way.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_72c5d86f3ff8.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_72c5d86f3ff8.mp3",
      "d": 3.814,
      "start": 329.378,
      "end": 333.192,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Frankly, I don't like this style.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_0cdeba1082b1.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_0cdeba1082b1.mp3",
      "d": 2.038,
      "start": 333.662,
      "end": 335.7,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Frankly, I can't be great at everything.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_3bcdf1bf2d0d.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_3bcdf1bf2d0d.mp3",
      "d": 2.456,
      "start": 336.17,
      "end": 338.625,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "It's like saying, \"I'm going to be honest with you.\"",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_e5db3b380a3e.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_e5db3b380a3e.mp3",
      "d": 3.344,
      "start": 339.095,
      "end": 342.439,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "And our last phrase today is the source of unhappiness.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_ab3e5fcfa7a6.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_ab3e5fcfa7a6.mp3",
      "d": 3.291,
      "start": 342.909,
      "end": 346.201,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "The source of unhappiness.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_ab4d7a03a525.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_ab4d7a03a525.mp3",
      "d": 1.959,
      "start": 346.671,
      "end": 348.63,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "The source of unhappiness.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_8f97169d2dae.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_8f97169d2dae.mp3",
      "d": 1.724,
      "start": 349.1,
      "end": 350.824,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "A source is the place something comes from. Unhappiness is the feeling of not being happy.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_0cae59bbb069.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_0cae59bbb069.mp3",
      "d": 6.4,
      "start": 351.295,
      "end": 357.695,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "So in this idea, too many desires are the source of unhappiness. You feel unhappy because you keep signing new contracts with yourself.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_1277dab2ae32.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_1277dab2ae32.mp3",
      "d": 7.706,
      "start": 358.165,
      "end": 365.871,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "I think that's pretty clear.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_9f64a32488f9.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_9f64a32488f9.mp3",
      "d": 1.802,
      "start": 366.341,
      "end": 368.144,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Yeah. Now, Paula, let's look at how some of these phrases work together.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_a41181f6cf89.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_a41181f6cf89.mp3",
      "d": 4.676,
      "start": 368.614,
      "end": 373.29,
      "segment": "takeaway"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "In this section, \"putting it together,\" we show you how to combine useful phrases, so you can say a complete idea, not just single words.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_17ad25061826.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_17ad25061826.mp3",
      "d": 8.777,
      "start": 373.917,
      "end": 382.694,
      "segment": "putting_it_together",
      "h": "Putting It Together"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Right. In the dialogue, Mark says: you have to be choosy about your desires. You have to focus.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_51138daf98ad.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_51138daf98ad.mp3",
      "d": 6.348,
      "start": 383.164,
      "end": 389.512,
      "segment": "putting_it_together"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "And Lily answers: frankly, I can't be great at everything. I'll just waste my energy.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_70d0b913d5ba.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_70d0b913d5ba.mp3",
      "d": 5.851,
      "start": 389.982,
      "end": 395.833,
      "segment": "putting_it_together"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "So let's put that together. If you want to be good at your work, you cannot want everything.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_6255c112952b.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_6255c112952b.mp3",
      "d": 5.094,
      "start": 396.304,
      "end": 401.398,
      "segment": "putting_it_together"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Let's listen to a few ways to say this.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_4e2738a036b7.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_4e2738a036b7.mp3",
      "d": 2.691,
      "start": 401.868,
      "end": 404.558,
      "segment": "putting_it_together"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Example one.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_51de88d5658f.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_51de88d5658f.mp3",
      "d": 1.071,
      "start": 404.872,
      "end": 405.943,
      "segment": "putting_it_together"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "If you want to do great work, you have to be choosy about your desires. You have to focus.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_b8baba7c1e43.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_b8baba7c1e43.mp3",
      "d": 5.93,
      "start": 406.256,
      "end": 412.186,
      "segment": "putting_it_together"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Example two.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_8796104f7e71.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_8796104f7e71.mp3",
      "d": 1.123,
      "start": 412.5,
      "end": 413.623,
      "segment": "putting_it_together"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Frankly, you can't be great at everything. You'll just waste your energy and waste your time.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_42901160e9c9.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_42901160e9c9.mp3",
      "d": 5.198,
      "start": 413.936,
      "end": 419.135,
      "segment": "putting_it_together"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Example three.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_81f68e1c6e10.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_81f68e1c6e10.mp3",
      "d": 1.254,
      "start": 419.448,
      "end": 420.702,
      "segment": "putting_it_together"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "I need to be choosy. I can't focus if I want too many things at the same time.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_a5448a6f7e59.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_a5448a6f7e59.mp3",
      "d": 5.251,
      "start": 421.015,
      "end": 426.266,
      "segment": "putting_it_together"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "So you can start with \"you have to be choosy about...\" and then add \"you have to focus.\"",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_02e31caab575.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_02e31caab575.mp3",
      "d": 5.303,
      "start": 426.736,
      "end": 432.039,
      "segment": "putting_it_together"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Or you can be direct: \"Frankly, I can't be great at everything. So I'll focus on this one thing for now.\"",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_b68f0838cbf5.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_b68f0838cbf5.mp3",
      "d": 6.818,
      "start": 432.509,
      "end": 439.327,
      "segment": "putting_it_together"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "That's a really useful sentence in real life. Okay, Paula, now let's look at how to say some of these phrases more naturally.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_6af216d73ada.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_6af216d73ada.mp3",
      "d": 6.922,
      "start": 439.798,
      "end": 446.72,
      "segment": "putting_it_together"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "In \"fluency builder,\" we look at phrases that help you sound more natural — the way people really talk.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_f702046df55d.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_f702046df55d.mp3",
      "d": 6.269,
      "start": 447.347,
      "end": 453.616,
      "segment": "fluency",
      "h": "Fluency Builder"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "That's right. Let's listen to the first one from the dialogue.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_508a58d7d148.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_508a58d7d148.mp3",
      "d": 3.422,
      "start": 454.087,
      "end": 457.509,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Phrase one: I can't be happy until I get all of it. I can't be happy until I get all of it.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_328b9a1d9e8e.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_328b9a1d9e8e.mp3",
      "d": 6.74,
      "start": 457.979,
      "end": 464.718,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "This is the desire contract in everyday words. \"I can't be happy until...\"",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_82c1bb3c5074.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_82c1bb3c5074.mp3",
      "d": 4.833,
      "start": 465.032,
      "end": 469.864,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "You can change the ending: I can't be happy until I finish this. I can't be happy until I move to a new place.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_048e13072c3c.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_048e13072c3c.mp3",
      "d": 6.74,
      "start": 470.335,
      "end": 477.074,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "But remember: that sentence is a contract. You're telling yourself to wait before you feel okay.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_32fbc98ed9b2.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_32fbc98ed9b2.mp3",
      "d": 5.721,
      "start": 477.544,
      "end": 483.265,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Yeah. Next phrase.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_2acb0889d83b.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_2acb0889d83b.mp3",
      "d": 2.038,
      "start": 483.579,
      "end": 485.616,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Phrase two: I pick them up without even thinking. I pick them up without even thinking.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_3d1ee6b25d09.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_3d1ee6b25d09.mp3",
      "d": 5.433,
      "start": 486.087,
      "end": 491.52,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "\"Without even thinking\" means it happens automatically. You don't plan it.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_ce9830028d19.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_ce9830028d19.mp3",
      "d": 4.545,
      "start": 491.833,
      "end": 496.379,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "I say yes without even thinking. I buy things without even thinking.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_1bd95d3f8c60.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_1bd95d3f8c60.mp3",
      "d": 4.232,
      "start": 496.849,
      "end": 501.081,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Very natural, and very common.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_6f0ee7875a51.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_6f0ee7875a51.mp3",
      "d": 2.56,
      "start": 501.551,
      "end": 504.111,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "And our last phrase today is a soft way to let something go.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_e106e2cf64ff.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_e106e2cf64ff.mp3",
      "d": 3.657,
      "start": 504.581,
      "end": 508.238,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Phrase three: Let the others go for now. Let the others go for now.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_f995523982ec.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_f995523982ec.mp3",
      "d": 5.747,
      "start": 508.709,
      "end": 514.455,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "\"For now\" is a really friendly little chunk. It means \"not forever, just at this time.\"",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_55129f00f8a0.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_55129f00f8a0.mp3",
      "d": 5.747,
      "start": 514.769,
      "end": 520.516,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "The studio can wait for now. I'll focus on my clients for now.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_4f1a80aabfd4.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_4f1a80aabfd4.mp3",
      "d": 4.127,
      "start": 520.986,
      "end": 525.113,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "You don't have to say no forever. You just say, not right now.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_5935a0ff7ac0.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_5935a0ff7ac0.mp3",
      "d": 3.997,
      "start": 525.584,
      "end": 529.58,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Okay, great. I think we're ready to listen to our dialogue a second time. This time, try to catch these phrases.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_879549fa0c2b.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_879549fa0c2b.mp3",
      "d": 6.922,
      "start": 530.051,
      "end": 536.973,
      "segment": "fluency"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Lily",
      "t": "Ugh, I spent all night looking at new phones. I want the latest one so badly.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_8d3816dcff80.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_8d3816dcff80.mp3",
      "d": 5.303,
      "start": 537.6,
      "end": 542.903,
      "segment": "dialogue_repeat",
      "h": "Dialogue (second time)"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Mark",
      "t": "Didn't you just get a new phone last year?",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_434ad9fc15cc.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_434ad9fc15cc.mp3",
      "d": 2.038,
      "start": 543.373,
      "end": 545.411,
      "segment": "dialogue_repeat"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Lily",
      "t": "Yeah, but this one is better. And I also want to rent a bigger studio. And maybe start selling my own lash products.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_18ce1b9314a5.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_18ce1b9314a5.mp3",
      "d": 7.053,
      "start": 545.881,
      "end": 552.934,
      "segment": "dialogue_repeat"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Mark",
      "t": "Lily, that's a lot of wants at the same time.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_1739c4ff760a.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_1739c4ff760a.mp3",
      "d": 2.821,
      "start": 553.404,
      "end": 556.225,
      "segment": "dialogue_repeat"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Lily",
      "t": "I know. I just feel like I can't be happy until I get all of it.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_b8414b33b8b7.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_b8414b33b8b7.mp3",
      "d": 4.545,
      "start": 556.695,
      "end": 561.241,
      "segment": "dialogue_repeat"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Mark",
      "t": "I heard an interesting idea about that. People say a desire is a contract you make with yourself to be unhappy until you get what you want. Every new desire is one more desire contract you sign.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_bdd0ac2bb6d4.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_bdd0ac2bb6d4.mp3",
      "d": 11.102,
      "start": 561.711,
      "end": 572.813,
      "segment": "dialogue_repeat"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Lily",
      "t": "A contract with myself? So I'm making myself unhappy on purpose?",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_12b9531d38c6.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_12b9531d38c6.mp3",
      "d": 4.963,
      "start": 573.283,
      "end": 578.247,
      "segment": "dialogue_repeat"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Mark",
      "t": "Not on purpose. But we pick up a lot of unnecessary desires everywhere — ads, videos, other people's lives.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_108b82716386.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_108b82716386.mp3",
      "d": 7.471,
      "start": 578.717,
      "end": 586.188,
      "segment": "dialogue_repeat"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Lily",
      "t": "That's true. I pick them up without even thinking.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_700320180e7c.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_700320180e7c.mp3",
      "d": 4.127,
      "start": 586.658,
      "end": 590.785,
      "segment": "dialogue_repeat"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Mark",
      "t": "If you want to be really good at your work, you have to be choosy about your desires. You have to focus.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_c5f9691a34cf.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_c5f9691a34cf.mp3",
      "d": 5.616,
      "start": 591.255,
      "end": 596.872,
      "segment": "dialogue_repeat"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Lily",
      "t": "Frankly, I can't be great at everything. I'll just waste my energy.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_8487376775af.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_8487376775af.mp3",
      "d": 4.545,
      "start": 597.342,
      "end": 601.887,
      "segment": "dialogue_repeat"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Mark",
      "t": "Exactly. Maybe keep one desire, and let the others go for now.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_43a3d707577a.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_43a3d707577a.mp3",
      "d": 4.258,
      "start": 602.358,
      "end": 606.615,
      "segment": "dialogue_repeat"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Lily",
      "t": "Okay. The studio can wait. The phone can wait. I'll focus on my clients this year.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_2cfa0aa2d3ff.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_2cfa0aa2d3ff.mp3",
      "d": 6.165,
      "start": 607.086,
      "end": 613.251,
      "segment": "dialogue_repeat"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Okay, Paula, so what do you think about this idea — the desire contract?",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_79fdcb108753.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_79fdcb108753.mp3",
      "d": 4.31,
      "start": 613.878,
      "end": 618.188,
      "segment": "outro",
      "h": "Outro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "I think it's a little uncomfortable, Ethan, but it's true.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_8d6ff20e47e3.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_8d6ff20e47e3.mp3",
      "d": 3.239,
      "start": 618.658,
      "end": 621.897,
      "segment": "outro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Uncomfortable?",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_4903d731daa9.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_4903d731daa9.mp3",
      "d": 0.967,
      "start": 622.211,
      "end": 623.177,
      "segment": "outro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Yeah, because I do this all the time. I see a nice bag, or a new course, or a better apartment, and suddenly I feel like my life is not enough.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_fe68d76a36e9.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_fe68d76a36e9.mp3",
      "d": 9.326,
      "start": 623.647,
      "end": 632.973,
      "segment": "outro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Right. You pick up a new desire, and then you sign that contract: I will be unhappy until I get it.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_2b103eb023f8.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_2b103eb023f8.mp3",
      "d": 6.165,
      "start": 633.443,
      "end": 639.608,
      "segment": "outro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Exactly. And frankly, I can't go after everything. I'll just waste my energy.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_a561d1325e85.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_a561d1325e85.mp3",
      "d": 6.087,
      "start": 640.078,
      "end": 646.165,
      "segment": "outro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Same here. I think the useful part is to be choosy. Keep one or two desires that really matter, and let the others go for now.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_65f1d88a6ee3.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_65f1d88a6ee3.mp3",
      "d": 7.889,
      "start": 646.635,
      "end": 654.524,
      "segment": "outro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Yes. Focus. You can't be great at everything.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_be37b7c06bb9.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_be37b7c06bb9.mp3",
      "d": 3.579,
      "start": 654.994,
      "end": 658.573,
      "segment": "outro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "That's a good sentence to take with you this week.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_46f3712d0164.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_46f3712d0164.mp3",
      "d": 2.377,
      "start": 659.043,
      "end": 661.42,
      "segment": "outro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Listeners, after this episode, maybe ask yourself: which desire contracts have I signed? And which ones can wait?",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_6bec962c2461.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_6bec962c2461.mp3",
      "d": 8.124,
      "start": 661.891,
      "end": 670.015,
      "segment": "outro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "You don't have to answer us. Just think about it the next time you want something new.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_c59762adc16a.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_c59762adc16a.mp3",
      "d": 4.362,
      "start": 670.485,
      "end": 674.847,
      "segment": "outro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "And that's all for our first episode of Open Talk. Thanks for listening.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_bf536dcaee14.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_bf536dcaee14.mp3",
      "d": 4.31,
      "start": 675.318,
      "end": 679.628,
      "segment": "outro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "We'll be back soon with another everyday conversation, and more useful English.",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_658b2bbd4441.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_658b2bbd4441.mp3",
      "d": 4.415,
      "start": 680.098,
      "end": 684.513,
      "segment": "outro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Paula",
      "t": "Until next time... goodbye!",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/F_f126294d6185.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/F_f126294d6185.mp3",
      "d": 2.508,
      "start": 684.983,
      "end": 687.491,
      "segment": "outro"
    },
    {
      "sp": "Ethan",
      "t": "Bye!",
      "a": "audio/talk_ep1/M_3ef3951420b9.mp3",
      "oa": "audio/talk_ep1/M_3ef3951420b9.mp3",
      "d": 0.731,
      "start": 687.804,
      "end": 688.535,
      "segment": "outro"
    }
  ]
}
